Subject: [PATCH 3/5] AC-3, AC-5: single-object responses derive overdue from
 one snapshot of the todo (review F-1)

Todo.to_dict() read done twice (asdict, then is_overdue), so a complete() landing
between the reads could return done false / overdue false for a past-due todo from
POST /todos. It now copies the todo once and builds both keys from the copy. The new
test injects the complete() right after the field read; red before, green after.
---
 app/storage.py        |  5 +++--
 tests/test_overdue.py | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/storage.py b/app/storage.py
index d23cf82..332a549 100644
--- a/app/storage.py
